&gt; Every night I tell me agents I&#x27;ll be going to bed and to not ask questions and keep going.<p>Most harnesses now support something like this:<p><pre><code>  &#x2F;goal &quot;Work on the current plan until 11 AM in my time zone, provide a summary of all the overnight work then.&quot;
</code></pre>
Other than that, look after your own wellbeing! Nothing wrong with letting agents work overnight, just don&#x27;t overextend yourself and don&#x27;t spend all of your free time on it.
